'' STATEMENT KEYWORDS AND SAME-NAMED METHODS, the programs fbc refuses: 'Close #1' beside a
'' Close method (fbc's 3), 'Print "x"' beside a Print sub (3), an empty 'Close( )' with no
'' Close method in reach (9, here the name is undeclared), a statement call with too many
'' arguments (3), and '( )' itself (9). Measured on fbc-modern 1.20. Each stopped the build
'' with an internal error, TKO0993 or TKO0994, instead of a diagnostic.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/diagnostics/src/method-named-like-statement-err.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: method-named-like-statement-err.bas(38,9): error TKO0400: expected an expression
'' EXPECT-OUT: method-named-like-statement-err.bas(39,26): error TKO0400: expected an expression
'' EXPECT-OUT: method-named-like-statement-err.bas(18,11): error TKO0400: expected an expression
'' EXPECT-OUT: method-named-like-statement-err.bas(28,5): error TKO0743: 'close' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: method-named-like-statement-err.bas(19,5): error TKO0775: this call passes 1 argument(s), but 'print' takes 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: method-named-like-statement-err.bas(35,1): error TKO0775: this call passes 1 argument(s), but 'foo' takes 0
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 6
